---
import Publisher from '../layouts/Publisher.astro';
import DrawnArt from '../components/DrawnArt.astro';
// Thesis: accessible stories can help us find our bearings as we learn to live with AI.
---
<Publisher title="About Scale of Us" description="A publishing house bringing ideas from thinkers and philosophers into illustrated stories about being human in the age of AI." active="about">
  <section class="about-simple wrap" id="beginning">
    <header>
      <p class="eyebrow">ABOUT SCALE OF US</p>
      <h1>Being human<br />in the age of AI.</h1>
    </header>
    <div class="about-body">
      <div class="about-copy" id="creator">
        <p>We’re learning to live with AI. We need stories that help us find our bearings: who we are, what matters to us, and how we live together.</p>
        <p>Scale of Us is a publishing house built around those questions. We bring ideas from thinkers and philosophers across time into illustrated stories anyone can read.</p>
        <p id="formats">You can follow a boy trying to catch the wind, or sit with his question to a machine: Who am I? We hope each reading gives you something new to notice in your own life.</p>
      </div>
      <DrawnArt name="n09" class="about-inquiry" eager />
    </div>
  </section>
</Publisher>
